# Ask the robot-info server (air26_robot_info, Task 3) for structural facts about
# the robot, parsed from its URDF (/robot_description).
#
# Task 3 asks you to extend BOTH this .srv and the node. Some ideas for extra
# request fields you might add: a category selector ("joint"/"link"/"summary"),
# or a flag to include child links. Add them here and rebuild.

# --- request ---
string query    # a joint name, a link name, or "" to ask for an overall summary
---
# --- response ---
bool success
string report   # human-readable; the node also prints this to its terminal
